= Internal Factions of the <span style="color: #990000;">**PNI**</span>

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Wilopo's faction mostly consists of moderate, younger figures of the party.">Wilopo Group</span>!} (<span style="color: #ff6d50;">**Moderates**</span>) <br>Strength: [+ wilopo_strength : strength +] <br>Dissent: [+ wilopo_dissent : dissent +]

<span class="tooltip-wrap">Sidik Group<span class="tooltip-tip"><img src="img/portraits/sidik.jpg">Sidik Djojosukarto and his clique pushes the party to a pro-labor and socialist stance.</span></span> (<span style="color: #e90000;">**Leftists**</span>) <br>Strength: [+ sidik_strength : strength +] <br>Dissent: [+ sidik_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Sartono-Suwirjo group are mostly administrators and bureaucrats who are more radical in their nationalism.">Sartono-Suwirjo Group</span>!} (<span style="color: #7c0000;">**Radicals**</span>) <br>Strength: [+ partindo_strength : strength +] <br>Dissent: [+ partindo_dissent : dissent +]

